Third-party audio
=================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the source code in this repository. It does
not cover the audio files, which keep the licences they were published under.

  public/test-audio/    34 clips used by the detector test page
                        22 CC0 1.0 (Freesound), 12 CC BY 4.0 / CC BY-SA 4.0
                        (Wikimedia Commons)

  public/demo/           8 lines spoken by a voice built with ElevenLabs
                         Voice Design, rendered for demo mode

Every clip is listed with its title, author, source URL and licence in
public/test-audio/SOURCES.md. Attribution requirements for the CC BY and
CC BY-SA clips are met there and on the /test page itself, where each clip
name links back to its original.
